# Follow mode on a walk east (12 m a second, a fix a second): off by default (the dot walks away from the centre while the
# map stays), G turns it on (the map recentres at once and on every fix, the zoom stays), a drag turns it off again
# (the dot walks away once more); the follow button (crosshair, below the zoom buttons) turns it on by touch, and the
# Home key does too. The follow button is highlighted while follow is on.
title GPS: follow mode, pan turns it off
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED follow
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1300
shot follow-off-start
expect text "3D fix 8 sats"
wait 3000
shot follow-off-walked

key g
wait 300
shot follow-on-at-once
wait 2500
shot follow-on-walked

drag 0.30 0.45 0.55 0.45
wait 300
shot follow-off-by-drag
wait 2500
shot follow-off-again

key home
wait 300
shot home-recentred
